security_hardening.remediation:
Option 1: Use react-markdown (already installed) with rehype-sanitize:
```tsx
import ReactMarkdown from 'react-markdown';
import rehypeSanitize from 'rehype-sanitize';
<ReactMarkdown rehypePlugins={[rehypeSanitize]}>{markdown}</ReactMarkdown>
```

Option 2: Use DOMPurify:
```tsx
import DOMPurify from 'dompurify';
const html = DOMPurify.sanitize(processedMarkdown, { ALLOWED_TAGS: ['h3','h4','strong','code','li','ul','br'] });
```
